{"task_id": "62b869ebb4d922cb0e688cc6", "_id": "62b869ebb4d922cb0e688cc6", "completion": "def update_last_applied_manifest_list_from_resp(\n    last_applied_manifest, observer_schema, response\n):\nfor i in range(len(observer_schema)):\n\t\tif i >= len(response):\n\t\t\tbreak\n\t\tif isinstance(observer_schema[i], list):\n\t\t\tif i >= len(last_applied_manifest):\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest.append({})\n\t\t\tupdate_last_applied_manifest_list_from_resp(\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[i], observer_schema[i], response[i]\n\t\t\t)\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tif i >= len(last_applied_manifest):\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest.append(None)\n\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[i] = response[i]", "generate_results": ["def update_last_applied_manifest_list_from_resp(\n    last_applied_manifest, observer_schema, response\n):\nfor i in range(len(observer_schema)):\n\t\tif i >= len(response):\n\t\t\tbreak\n\t\tif isinstance(observer_schema[i], list):\n\t\t\tif i >= len(last_applied_manifest):\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest.append({})\n\t\t\tupdate_last_applied_manifest_list_from_resp(\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[i], observer_schema[i], response[i]\n\t\t\t)\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tif i >= len(last_applied_manifest):\n\t\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest.append(None)\n\t\t\tlast_applied_manifest[i] = response[i]"]}
