{"task_id": "62ece4992e6aefcf4aabbd7b", "_id": "62ece4992e6aefcf4aabbd7b", "completion": "def write_configuration(config_filename, rendered_config, mode=0o600, overwrite=False):\nif os.path.exists(config_filename):\n\t\tif not overwrite:\n\t\t\tprint(\"Config file already exists. Aborting.\")\n\t\t\tsys.exit(1)\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tprint(\"Overwriting existing config file.\")\n\telse:\n\t\tprint(\"Creating new config file.\")\n\n\twith open(config_filename, 'w') as f:\n\t\tf.write(rendered_config)\n\tos.chmod(config_filename, mode)", "generate_results": ["def write_configuration(config_filename, rendered_config, mode=0o600, overwrite=False):\nif os.path.exists(config_filename):\n\t\tif not overwrite:\n\t\t\tprint(\"Config file already exists. Aborting.\")\n\t\t\tsys.exit(1)\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tprint(\"Overwriting existing config file.\")\n\telse:\n\t\tprint(\"Creating new config file.\")\n\n\twith open(config_filename, 'w') as f:\n\t\tf.write(rendered_config)\n\tos.chmod(config_filename, mode)"]}
